<title>UK: Astra to step up Japan, China marketing.</title>
<headline>Astra to step up Japan, China marketing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drugs group Astra said on Monday it planned to increase its marketing organisations in Japan and China.</p>
<p>&quot;The Japanese sales organisation currently includes 500 people. We expect to continue recruiting 50 to 60 people annually,&quot; Mogren told a seminar.</p>
<p>Several key launches are expected in Japan, including the Pulmicort Tubuhaler and Losec for long-term treatment.</p>
<p>In China Astra has a sales organisation of 350 people.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to double this in the coming three years,&quot; Morgren said.</p>
<p>-- Joel Dahlberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1011</p>
</text>
